      "label": "Reconstruction Summary",
      "value": "<p>A single leaf from a 12th-century antiphonary containing texts for the Feast of St Martin, Bishop of Tours (11 November). Repurposed as a pastedown at the front of the incunabulum X 77, an edition of Aurelius Augustinus', <em>De civitate dei</em> and <em>De trinitate </em>from 1489.  </p>"
